 Bağlı","x0":0.2443531768522212,"x1":0.8008213609301194,"top":0.3648255813365898,"bottom":0.3750000000549767,"conf":1},{"text":"Sağlık Kurumları ile Esenlendirme (Rehabilitasyon) Tesislerine Verilecek Döner Sermaye","x0":0.2443532029689759,"x1":0.8008213501453286,"top":0.3750000000905409,"bottom":0.38675213684267773,"conf":1},{"text":"Hakkında Kanunun ek 2 nci maddesi aşağıdaki şekilde değiştirilmiştir.","x0":0.24229978762369483,"x1":0.6529774195600045,"top":0.3880341878697082,"bottom":0.4012820511175714,"conf":1},{"text":"\"EK MADDE 2- Sağhk Bakanlığına bağlı döner sermaye işletmelerinin muhasebe","x0":0.2833675531072558,"x1":0.7987679703013686,"top":0.39957264963667904,"bottom":0.4115384616024911,"conf":1},{"text":"hizmetleri Bakanlıkça yürütülür. Ancak, Bakanlık tarafindan teklif edilen ve Hazine ve Maliye","x0":0.24229978955515735,"x1":0.8008213601321676,"top":0.4113372091102885,"bottom":0.4244186048382448,"conf":1},{"text":"Bakanlığınca uygun gürülen düner sermaye İşletmelerinin muhasebe hizmetleri Hazine ve","x0":0.24435317684300212,"x1":0.8008213609209003,"top":0.422965116153483,"bottom":0.4346153845940557,"conf":1},{"text":"Maliye Bakanlığı tarafından yüratalebilir.\"","x0":0.24217779934183767,"x1":0.501177754174346,"top":0.4330657375298912,"bottom":0.44872114017803455,"conf":1},{"text":"Yapılan değişiklik ile Hazine ve Maliye Bakanlığınca yürütülen Bakanlığımız düner","x0":0.283367553898109,"x1":0.8008213575913339,"top":0.4461538459804827,"bottom":0.4594017092283459,"conf":1},{"text":"sermaye işletmelerinin muhasebe hizmetleri, mezkur madde uyanınca 01/04/2019 taribinden","x0":0.24435317702157291,"x1":0.8008213610994712,"top":0.4576923077431818,"bottom":0.46965811970899385,"conf":1},{"text":"İtibaren Bakanlığımızca yürütülecektir.","x0":0.24435317870475337,"x1":0.47227926461391295,"top":0.47093023249642674,"bottom":0.48119658134338394,"conf":1},{"text":"Bu meyanda, Bakanlığımız döner sermaye işletmelerinin muhasebe iş ve işlemlerini","x0":0.28537349731019995,"x1":0.8008873867567123,"top":0.48089034725864166,"bottom":0.4943467049048338,"conf":1},{"text":"yürütecek muhasebe birimlerinin oluşturulmast ve muhasebe hizmetlerinin etkin ve mevzuata","x0":0.24435317684275176,"x1":0.80082136092065,"top":0.49401709401427163,"bottom":0.5059829059800837,"conf":1},{"text":"uygun bir şekilde yürütülebilmesi maksadıyla hazırlanan ekli \"Sağlık Bakanlığında Döner","x0":0.24435317685696648,"x1":0.8008213609348648,"top":0.5058139533627156,"bottom":0.5175213676800504,"conf":1},{"text":"Sermaye Muhasebe Hizmetlerinin Yürütülmesine İlişkin Yönerge\" taslağının yürürlüğe","x0":0.24435319774994818,"x1":0.8008213449263011,"top":0.5158119656839982,"bottom":0.5290697671148553,"conf":1},{"text":"konulması hususunu tensiplerinize arz ederim.","x0":0.24435318538985307,"x1":0.5133470197320255,"top":0.5290598291309643,"bottom":0.5406976745371298,"conf":1},{"text":"Abitęson","x0":0.6078028772646286,"x1":0.7330595459643243,"top":0.5465116274251448,"bottom":0.5872093022986925,"conf":0.30000001192092896},{"text":"Dr. Abdulvahit SÖZÜER","x0":0.6139630396037095,"x1":0.7679671469671324,"top":0.5841880343226037,"bottom":0.5974358975704669,"conf":1},{"text":"Başkan","x0":0.6650293737648814,"x1":0.716900810736156,"top":0.5968392321587787,"bottom":0.611009604950558,"conf":1},{"text":"Uygun Görürle Arz Ederim.","x0":0.24215503472668803,"x1":0.4087474862351051,"top":0.6440267774594235,"bottom":0.65727941967525,"conf":1},{"text":"Prof. Dr. Muhammel GÜVEN","x0":0.24435318730182523,"x1":0.4229979418799786,"top":0.6786324788231307,"bottom":0.6918803420709939,"conf":1},{"text":"Bakan Yardımcisı","x0":0.28131416958057914,"x1":0.3921971235611046,"top":0.6904069768313656,"bottom":0.7034883717442157,"conf":1},{"text":"OLUR","x0":0.4928131407870643,"x1":0.5503080088891322,"top":0.7383720928553194,"bottom":0.750000000078491,"conf":1},{"text":"../.. / 2619","x0":0.4797015973903082,"x1":0.5591796386828424,"top":0.7476838428183464,"bottom":0.7635127302361315,"conf":0.5},{"te